{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123090317910-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123090728\"/><p>港鐵何文田站附近有信號設備故障。</p><p>今日(23日)早上9時02分，港鐵宣布，由於何文田站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，觀塘綫整體行車時間（總站至總站）預計需要額外10至15分鐘。港鐵人員正在處理。請乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T01:23:28.957040+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:03:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T01:17:24.666984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T01:17:24.666984+00:00","content_hash":"ac790214241ddb3d95b84959ce3b4080de01d930a9748c4b72bfb1fe291dc326","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}